  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The decomposition of formic acid on gold surface follows first order kinetics. If the rate constant at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and the activation energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>488</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, the rate constant at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is&nbsp;_________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. (Round of to the Nearest Integer).</p><p>(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>300</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>200</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>488</mn><mi>KJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>300</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>200</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>300</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>200</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>488</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>300</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mn>200</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>200</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>300</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
